## Nextflow Usage

```bash
# Check local Nextflow/Java prerequisites
make nextflow-prereqs

# Validate config
nextflow config -profile {{ nextflow_default_profile }}

# Fast smoke run
nextflow run main.nf -profile test,{{ nextflow_default_profile }} --input "data/test/samplesheet.csv" --outdir results-test
```

- Generated config targets Nextflow 25 and includes `apptainer` profile support.
{%- if include_aws_batch %}
- AWS Batch profile scaffolding is generated (`-profile awsbatch`) with queue/region/workDir defaults.
- Private ECR is wired by default through `process.container` using `{{ ecr_registry }}/{{ ecr_repository }}:{{ ecr_image_tag }}`.
- Configure `AWS_ROLE_TO_ASSUME` in GitHub Actions to enable OIDC-based ECR publishing.
{%- else %}
- Enable `include_aws_batch` to generate an `awsbatch` profile and private ECR defaults.
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}

## Development

