- Python {{ python_version }}+
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) for package management
{%- if include_nextflow %}
- Java 17+ runtime and Nextflow CLI for pipeline validation/execution
{%- endif %}

### Setup

```bash
git clone https://github.com/{{ github_username }}/{{ repository_name }}.git
cd {{ repository_name }}
make install
```

### Running Tests

```bash
